<title>RUSSIA: Rouble firms to 3,532 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble firms to 3,532 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged up to 3,532 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,535 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 21		  Oct 18</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,532		   3,535</p>
<p> Volume traded (mln DEM)    0.67		    1.83</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
